    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this substantial 4 bedroom detached family residence extending to approximately 290 sq.m. (3,122 sq.ft.), set on approximately 0.54 acres in the picturesque waterside village of Rooskey. Built in 1998 and presented in very good condition throughout, this impressive property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation ideally suited to modern family living.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious living room with feature fireplace, conservatory, separate dining room, fully fitted kitchen with central island and access to the rear garden, utility room, guest toilet and ground floor bedroom. Upstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, a second bedroom with ensuite and built-in wardrobe, together with a further bedroom and a large family bathroom with separate bath and shower.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys attractive front and rear gardens, a rear patio area, tarmac driveway and detached garage, providing excellent outdoor space and useful additional storage. Ideally located within the popular village of Rooskey, the property is within walking distance of local shops, schools, bars, restaurants and recreational facilities, while the nearby towns of Carrick-on-Shannon & Longford provide further amenities and transport links.\n\nOffering substantial living accommodation, generous bedrooms and excellent outdoor space in a convenient village setting, this property represents an excellent opportunity for families seeking a spacious detached home in Co. Leitrim.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the space, condition and excellent family accommodation this property has to offer and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent. ***OPEN VIEWING on TUESDAY 22/09/2026 - PLEASE CALL OUR OFFICE ON 071 9645555 TO BOOK YOUR SLOT!**"
      },
